      <string _locid="88882030">Treaty of Fredrikshamn</string>
      <string _locid="88882031">Adds technologies to the Church that ship troops when researched: Streltsy of Noteborg (Age II), Halberdiers of Viborg and Ingrian Recruits (Age III), and Cannon Shipment (Age IV). Also unlocks the Blockhouse Veteran/Guard/Imperial upgrades and the Northern Musketeers card (Age IV).</string>
