      <string _locid="88882033">Research at the Church for 500 food to ship 13 Streltsy.</string>
      <string _locid="88882034">Halberdiers of Viborg</string>
      <string _locid="88882035">Research at the Church for 1000 coin to ship 14 Halberdiers.</string>
      <string _locid="88882036">Ingrian Recruits</string>
      <string _locid="88882037">Research at the Church for 1000 wood to ship 16 Rekruts (Russian musketeers).</string>
      <string _locid="88882038">Shipment of Cannons</string>
      <string _locid="88882039">Research at the Church for 500 food to ship 2 Leather Cannons and enable them as trainable at the Blockhouse from Age II.</string>
