      <string _locid="88882098">Finnish Revolution</string>
      <string _locid="88882099">Finland breaks away from Sweden: the Karelian Jaeger (Skirmisher) becomes a builder/gatherer with its real veteran look, trainable at the Town Center and the Blockhouse. The Settler is not lost.</string>
      <string _locid="88882100">End of the Revolution</string>
      <string _locid="88882101">Regains normal age advancement after the Revolution (Finland jumps straight to Age III). The Karelian Jaeger keeps its ability to build and gather.</string>
      <string _locid="88882102" symbol="cStringFINHaveReturned">Finland has returned to the path of progress!</string>
      <string _locid="88882103" symbol="cStringFINPlayersColonyReturned">%s has ended the REVOLUTION!</string>
