      <string _locid="88882405">Research at the Church to upgrade Streltsy, Halberdiers, Rekruts and Leather Cannons trained at the Blockhouse to Veteran (+20% hitpoints and attack). Requires Age III.</string>
      <string _locid="88882406">Blockhouse Guard</string>
      <string _locid="88882407">Upgrades Blockhouse units to Guard (+35% hitpoints and attack). Requires Blockhouse Veterancy and Age IV.</string>
      <string _locid="88882408">Blockhouse Imperial Army</string>
